    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d416-a2-a11">

                <pb facs="0741" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg671"/>

                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jas. Viosca</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">American Consul, La Paz;</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I have here your note to the collector
                    of the port stating that I was detained by the Mexican crew, misused by them. I
                    deny the charge.</p>
                <closer><signed>GEO. CALEB</signed>.</closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>This is to certify that the foregoing is a correct copy of the, original,
                        which was in English.</p>
                    <p>La Paz, Julio diez y siete de mil ochocientas ochenta ytoes.</p>
                    <table cols="1" rows="1">
                        <row>
                            <cell>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>]</cell>
                            <cell>O. NUNEZ.</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
